              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ngawona malaika uko kimusi iruwenyi, nao ukawanga nyonyi rose riburukagha mbeonyi kwa lwaka lubaa, “Choonyi mkwanyike chia imweri, muje karamu mbaa ya Mlungu;",
          "type": "text",
